            <ArticleTitle>Endothelial dysfunction and its role in the cycle of cardiovascular disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5D-7D</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Over the past 10 years there have been significant advances in the understanding of multiple mechanisms in endothelial dysfunction and the association of endothelial dysfunction with a wide spectrum of cardiovascular diseases. An overview of normal endothelial function and endothelial dysfunction, and a unifying model to illustrate the cascade of events that occur in the coronary artery disease process are presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
